#: matesla/forms.py:65
msgid ""
"Paste a domain (example.com), an origin (https://example.com), or the full "
"public-key URL. Hosting is free choice (nginx, S3, Cloudflare, GitHub Pages,"
" …) but Tesla always fetches /.well-known/appspecific/com.tesla.3p.public-"
"key.pem on that host. Add the same host with https:// as Allowed Origin on "
"developer.tesla.com. Not localhost."
msgstr ""
"Lim inn et domene (example.com), en origin (https://example.com) eller den "
"fullstendige URL-en til den offentlige nøkkelen. Hosting er valgfritt "
"(nginx, S3, Cloudflare, GitHub Pages, …), men Tesla henter alltid /.well-"
"known/appspecific/com.tesla.3p.public-key.pem på den verten. Legg til samme "
"vert med https:// som Allowed Origin på developer.tesla.com. Ikke localhost."

