#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:341
msgid ""
"Habit model is trusted. For idle/asleep hours it can set 5, 15 or 30 minute "
"spacing from historical weekday+hour patterns. Live drive, charge and cabin "
"activity always keep the short reactive intervals."
msgstr ""
"Vanemodellen er pålitelig. I hvile/søvn kan den sette 5, 15 eller 30 "
"minutter fra historiske ukedag+time-mønstre. Kjøring, lading og kupe "
"beholder alltid de korte reaktive intervallene."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:346
msgid "No VIN is available, so habit-based spacing cannot run."
msgstr "Ingen VIN tilgjengelig, så vanebasert avstand kan ikke kjøre."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:349
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Not enough reference weeks of telemetry before the last %(recent)s days "
"(have %(have)s, need at least %(need)s). Capture uses only the default "
"day/night spacing until history is long enough."
msgstr ""
"Ikke nok referanseuker telemetri før de siste %(recent)s dagene (har "
"%(have)s, trenger minst %(need)s). Capture bruker bare standard dag/natt-"
"avstand til historikken er lang nok."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:360
msgid ""
"Recent mobility does not match the reference weeks (regime break). Habits "
"are disabled so a school↔holiday or trip change cannot stretch polls "
"incorrectly. Default day/night spacing is used until patterns look "
"consistent again."
msgstr ""
"Nylig mobilitet matcher ikke referanseukene (regimeskifte). Vaner er "
"deaktivert så skole↔ferie eller en tur ikke strekker spørringer feil. "
"Standard dag/natt-avstand brukes til mønstrene ser konsistente ut igjen."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:367
msgid ""
"There are enough reference weeks, but no weekday+hour slot was classified "
"quiet, moderate or busy. Default spacing only."
msgstr ""
"Det er nok referanseuker, men ingen ukedag+time-luke ble klassifisert som "
"rolig, moderat eller travelt. Kun standardavstand."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:370
#, python-format
msgid "Habit model is not trusted (%(reason)s). Default spacing only."
msgstr "Vanemodellen er ikke pålitelig (%(reason)s). Kun standardavstand."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:explain_regime_detail
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Driving activity fell sharply: about %(recent).1f h of mobility per day over "
"the last %(recent_days)s days, versus %(ref).1f h/day during the training "
"weeks (often school → holidays). Habits stay off until patterns re-align."

msgstr ""
"Kjøreaktivitet falt kraftig: omtrent %(recent).1f timer mobilitet per dag de "
"siste %(recent_days)s dagene, mot %(ref).1f t/dag i treningsukene (ofte skole "
"→ ferie). Vaner holdes av til mønsteret stemmer igjen."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:explain_regime_detail
msgid ""
"Driving activity fell sharply versus the training weeks (often school → "
"holidays). Habits stay off until patterns re-align."
msgstr ""
"Kjøreaktivitet falt kraftig mot treningsukene (ofte skole → ferie). Vaner "
"holdes av til mønsteret stemmer igjen."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:explain_regime_detail
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Driving activity rose sharply: about %(recent).1f h of mobility per day over "
"the last %(recent_days)s days, versus %(ref).1f h/day during the training "
"weeks (often holidays → school, or a trip). Habits stay off until patterns "
"re-align."

msgstr ""
"Kjøreaktivitet steg kraftig: omtrent %(recent).1f timer mobilitet per dag de "
"siste %(recent_days)s dagene, mot %(ref).1f t/dag i treningsukene (ofte ferie "
"→ skole, eller en tur). Vaner holdes av til mønsteret stemmer igjen."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:explain_regime_detail
msgid ""
"Driving activity rose sharply versus the training weeks (often holidays → "
"school, or a trip). Habits stay off until patterns re-align."
msgstr ""
"Kjøreaktivitet steg kraftig mot treningsukene (ofte ferie → skole, eller en "
"tur). Vaner holdes av til mønsteret stemmer igjen."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:explain_regime_detail
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Several recent drives (%(count)s hour-slots) happened at weekday+hour times "
"that were almost never mobile in the training weeks. Habits stay off until "
"patterns re-align."
msgstr ""
"Flere nylige turer (%(count)s timespor) skjedde på ukedag+time som nesten "
"aldri var mobile i treningsukene. Vaner holdes av til mønsteret stemmer "
"igjen."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:explain_regime_detail
msgid ""
"Several recent drives happened at weekday+hour times that were almost never "
"mobile in the training weeks. Habits stay off until patterns re-align."
msgstr ""
"Flere nylige turer skjedde på ukedag+time som nesten aldri var mobile i "
"treningsukene. Vaner holdes av til mønsteret stemmer igjen."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:explain_regime_detail
msgid ""
"Recent driving does not match the training weeks (regime change). Habits "
"stay off until patterns re-align."
msgstr ""
"Nylig kjøring matcher ikke treningsukene (rytmeendring). Vaner holdes av til "
"mønsteret stemmer igjen."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:441
msgid "night"
msgstr "natt"

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:441
msgid "day"
msgstr "dag"

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:447
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Driving with navigation ETA %(eta)s min → query every %(minutes)s min (1 min "
"when ETA ≤ 3 min or approaching a Supercharger; 2 min near arrival / crawl; "
"%(mid)s min mid-trip; %(far)s min when ETA is long). Habits do not apply "
"while driving."
msgstr ""
"Kjøring med navigasjons-ETA %(eta)s min → spørring hvert %(minutes)s min (1 "
"min ved ETA ≤ 3 min eller Supercharger-nærming; 2 min nær ankomst / sakte; "
"%(mid)s min midt i turen; %(far)s min ved lang ETA). Vaner gjelder ikke "
"under kjøring."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:458
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Driving without navigation ETA → dense %(minutes)s min queries (stretch only"
" when Tesla reports minutes-to-arrival). Habits do not apply while driving."
msgstr ""
"Kjøring uten navigasjons-ETA → tette spørringer hvert %(minutes)s min "
"(strekk bare når Tesla gir minutter til ankomst). Vaner gjelder ikke under "
"kjøring."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:464
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Live activity “%(activity)s” → reactive default spacing %(minutes)s min "
"(%(day_or_night)s). Habits do not apply while the car is active."
msgstr ""
"Live-aktivitet «%(activity)s» → reaktiv standardavstand %(minutes)s min "
"(%(day_or_night)s). Vaner gjelder ikke mens bilen er aktiv."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:474
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Idle/asleep policy: no drive and no charge for a long stretch → minimum "
"spacing %(minutes)s min (10 min after 24 h, 15 min after 48 h). Baseline "
"would be %(baseline)s min."
msgstr ""
"Tomgang/søvn: ingen kjøring og ingen lading over lengre tid → minimum "
"%(minutes)s min (10 min etter 24 t, 15 min etter 48 t). Standard ville være "
"%(baseline)s min."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:488
#, python-format
msgid ""
"(long-idle floor %(floor)s min also applies but habit is already as sparse "
"or sparser.)"
msgstr ""
"(gulv for lang inaktivitet %(floor)s min gjelder også, men vanen er allerede"
" like spredt eller mer.)"

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:492
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Idle/asleep policy: habit class “%(habit_class)s” sets %(minutes)s min for "
"this weekday+hour (default would be %(baseline)s min, %(day_or_night)s)."
msgstr ""
"Hvile/søvn-policy: vaneklasse «%(habit_class)s» setter %(minutes)s min for "
"denne ukedag+time (standard ville vært %(baseline)s min, %(day_or_night)s)."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:502
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Idle/asleep policy: slot is historically moderate, but at night moderate "
"does not densify — keep night default %(minutes)s min."
msgstr ""
"Hvile/søvn-policy: luken er historisk moderat, men om natten fortetter ikke "
"moderat — natt-standard %(minutes)s min beholdes."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:506
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Idle/asleep policy: no habit for this weekday+hour → %(day_or_night)s "
"default %(minutes)s min."
msgstr ""
"Hvile/søvn-policy: ingen vane for denne ukedag+time → "
"%(day_or_night)s-standard %(minutes)s min."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:854
msgid ""
"The week grid describes idle/asleep/sentry spacing only. If the car drives, "
"DC/AC charges or has cabin activity, capture switches to the short reactive "
"default until that ends."
msgstr ""
"Uke-rutenettet beskriver bare hvile/søvn/sentry-avstand. Hvis bilen kjører, "
"lader (DC/AC) eller har kupeaktivitet, bytter capture til kort reaktiv "
"standard til det er over."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:859
#, python-format
msgid ""
"After %(soft_h)s h with no drive and no charge, idle spacing is at least "
"%(soft_m)s min; after %(hard_h)s h at least %(hard_m)s min (even if the day "
"default or a busy habit would be denser). Night default %(night)s min is "
"already sparser."
msgstr ""
"Etter %(soft_h)s t uten kjøring og lading er tomgangsintervallet minst "
"%(soft_m)s min; etter %(hard_h)s t minst %(hard_m)s min (selv om "
"dagsstandard eller en travel vane ville vært tettere). Nattstandard "
"%(night)s min er allerede mer spredt."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:872
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Habits use at most the last %(lookback)s days, require %(min_weeks)s "
"reference weeks before the last %(recent)s days, and disable themselves on a"
" regime break."
msgstr ""
"Vaner bruker høyst de siste %(lookback)s dagene, krever %(min_weeks)s "
"referanseuker før de siste %(recent)s dagene, og deaktiveres ved "
"regimeskifte."

#: matesla/poll_diagnostics.py:882
#, python-format
#| msgid ""
#| "When habits are trusted, every weekday+hour is busy (%(busy)s min), quiet "
#| "(%(quiet)s min), or moderate (%(moderate)s min by day; night moderate keeps "
#| "the %(night)s min night default). There is no idle “default hole” in the "
#| "grid — only untrusted models fall back to day %(day)s / night %(night)s "
#| "everywhere."
msgid ""
"When habits are trusted, every weekday+hour is busy (%(busy)s min), near-"
"busy (%(near)s min, ±1 h around a busy core), quiet (%(quiet)s min), or "
"moderate (%(moderate)s min by day; night moderate keeps the %(night)s min "
"night default). There is no idle “default hole” in the grid — only untrusted"
" models fall back to day %(day)s / night %(night)s everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Når vaner er pålitelige, er hver ukedag+time travelt (%(busy)s min), nær "
"travelt (%(near)s min, ±1 t rundt en kjerne), rolig (%(quiet)s min) eller "
"moderat (%(moderate)s min på dag; om natten beholder moderat nattdefault "
"%(night)s min). Ingen «defaulthull» i rutenettet — bare upålitelige modeller"
" faller tilbake til dag %(day)s / natt %(night)s overalt."

